  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>合作案例</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>一、网易云音乐车机版</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.1 分发优势</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/8776d9c6d3794866aa9b8f803f8eb7d1.png?auth_key=1795677430-936ab72b7cbb4dcfb268f58c6ee0a940-0-7d69e16376e1ed39dc5e6a86d0e3d8d02fecd15f19013010da602265cb0cbbf6\" alt=\"1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1292.13px;height: 255.19px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 分发优势</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 智能语音联动</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>车机智能语音控制：</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•播放一首我喜欢的歌</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•我想听“out of The woods”</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/f061c180e1124e1db4f28e4628b21fb7.png?auth_key=1795677430-061aceede85d4ad79b6667201d0618e7-0-a20af61976aa212c56672a5528f3884c84007775e3e4e11751b7e8274ed4465f\" alt=\"2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 智能语音联动</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">*功能实现与车机系统相关，以实际为准。</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.3 场景自动化</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>适用场景：在车上短暂休息</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>小憩场景：加班一天太累了，我先休息一下</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•打开网易云音乐</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•播放舒缓的歌曲</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•关闭车窗</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•调整空调温度</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/121438e152ef41e9b9ebf944f67019fb.png?auth_key=1795677430-8e0b4acc7c904c0dbd76decaa17895c1-0-e6be9ecafb5a1e5cf20eea6552db27f5142ee27bcc09894e0b9c33481372aad3\" alt=\"3.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 场景自动化</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">*功能实现与车机系统相关，以实际为准。</span></p>"
